# A screw thread edited as one (an extension): made through its screen,
# then made again from its helix group's [edit thread], rounded and longer.
answer ok
menu Features|Screw Thread...
key c
move 300 300
down L 300 300
up L 300 300
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
key esc
key x shift
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
menu Features|Screw Thread...
tw
dump
# The designation, the length, an internal thread, then make it.
twmove 172 110
twdown L 172 110
twup L 172 110
edit M6x1
twmove 220 150
twdown L 220 150
twup L 220 150
edit 9
twmove 181 190
twdown L 181 190
twup L 181 190
tw
# Flip the direction: against the circle's normal, down into the part.
twmove 60 230
twdown L 60 230
twup L 60 230
twmove 37 260
twdown L 37 260
twup L 37 260
tw
dump
# The helix group's screen: edit the thread, rounded and 12 long.
twmove 200 110
twdown L 200 110
twup L 200 110
tw
twmove 546 190
